      "content": "but there are no more chapters left. i've done everything there was to do. i served my time and fulfilled my role. it feels like i'm just an old engine running on nothing, idling in a garage. if the purpose is gone, and there's nothing left to contribute... what's the point of the maintenance? why keep the engine running just to wait for the end?",
